    "text": "12 hours ago Adobe Stock OPINION — We have seen and heard a lot about both socialism and communism since the 2026 election has gotten heated up. Much of it is inaccurate at best.\nLet me see if I can cut through some of the fog and nonsense spouted by the proponents of these philosophies to help our community understand just what I believe they’re being tricked into supporting.\nNever forget that both are close on the same continuum, not opposites.",
